%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4fafe43b89343e3a7ba1235e8987c0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Epilogue3_1_WesternMarsh
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: "Finally... I\u2019m beat."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4be3841f8f6da4f3ca84917932aa6724, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513821
  - content: "Yeah, I\u2019m ready to crash."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a43544c7607a84bad870a2ff50a662f5, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513822
  - content: Strike team, a heads-up before you all get settled.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513823
    - rid: 314095995325513826
    - rid: 314095995325513827
    - rid: 314095995325513824
    - rid: 314095995325513825
    - rid: 314095995325513828
    - rid: 7570221391745384511
  - content: The Tundra was forbidden up until now for a reason. It sets record Waste
      contamination levels.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: I expect all of you to carry at least one Anti-Waste Serum at all times,
      no exceptions.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f29addafedd7075418d577a938699eee, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: 'If you have any direct contact with the Waste, inject the serum into
      your upper arm once it''s safe. Even for a light graze. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f29addafedd7075418d577a938699eee, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: 'By the time you see the purple marks on the body that you all know
      as blackvein a couple days later. It will be too late. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f29addafedd7075418d577a938699eee, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: "To prevent physical contact with the Waste, Cam will now explain the
      purpose behind the new gloves you\u2019ve been issued."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Your encounters with the Waste Creatures up to this point have been
      calibrating these gloves.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513829
    - rid: 314095995325513830
    - rid: 314095995325513831
    - rid: 314095995325513832
    - rid: 314095995325513834
  - content: 'They will allow you to turn into Waste Creatures you have fought. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: The more experiences you have, the more accurate the replication.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: On your glove you can scroll through which Waste Creature to resonate
      with, and with a snap, you will be able to transform.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Like this!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 504
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 504
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 6570561757010722879
    - rid: 7570221391745384514
